B.a9m=new A.lm("say","The words you say","These are the two sentences. The boxes are so you can read them and say them. They are not a Quran verse by themselves. The report of this testimony is in Sahih al-Bukhari, in the next chapter.","Say them only if you mean them. This app does not make you Muslim. Sit with the imam and say them in person.",B.H,null,B.vL,B.i3)
B.a0Z=s(["3:18","47:19"],t.s)
B.fJ=s([],t.Ax)
B.a9o=new A.lm("first","The first sentence in the Quran","These verses state that there is no god but Allah. The testimony you say adds that you bear witness, and it adds the second sentence. Both sentences together are in the hadith, not in one verse.",null,B.a0Z,null,B.fJ,B.i3)
B.a_I=s(["48:29","33:40"],t.s)
B.a9k=new A.lm("second","The second sentence in the Quran","The Quran states that Muhammad (peace be upon him) is the messenger of Allah, and the last of the prophets. The first verse below begins with that sentence, then describes the people with him. Read the whole verse.","We worship Allah alone. We do not worship the Prophet (peace be upon him).",B.a_I,null,B.fJ,B.i3)
B.a_s=s([B.a9m,B.a9o,B.a9k],t.dY)
B.a9h=new A.wQ("words","The two sentences","Read them, then the verses they come from.",B.nY,B.a_s)
B.a9i=new A.lm("five","The first of the five","The Prophet (peace be upon him) said Islam stands on five things. The first is this testimony. Read his words. Do not swap them for a shorter list of your own.","A wording in Sahih Muslim is also well known. If the two seem to differ, ask the imam. Do not pick one and ignore the other.",B.H,8,B.fJ,B.i3)
B.a9n=new A.lm("muadh","What to teach first",'When the Prophet (peace be upon him) sent Muadh to Yemen, he told him to invite people to the testimony first. In this report he says "I am Allah\'s Messenger", because he is the one speaking. The sentence you say is "Muhammad is the messenger of Allah". If they accepted it, he said to teach the five daily prayers, then zakat taken from the wealthy and given to the poor.',"Do not work out a zakat amount from this page. The rate and the rules are for the imam.",B.H,1395,B.fJ,B.i3)
B.a0w=s([B.a9i,B.a9n],t.dY)
B.a9e=new A.wQ("books","The hadith","What the Prophet (peace be upon him) said, loaded as published.",B.fG,B.a0w)
B.a9w=new A.mm(B.uH,"Know both sentences","Hear them in Arabic and know the meaning. If a word is unclear, ask before you say it.")
B.a9r=new A.mm(B.fF,"Say it at the mosque","Say both sentences in person. People are usually there as witnesses. A photo or a post is not the shahada.")
B.uW=new A.ab(984725,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a9y=new A.mm(B.uW,"Ask what comes next","The imam tells you about washing and the first prayer. Schools differ. Follow him, not a guess from an app.")
B.Xi=new A.ab(984585,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a9v=new A.mm(B.Xi,"This app does not convert you","There is no button here that makes you Muslim. The testimony is said to Allah, with the imam.")
B.a_W=s([B.a9w,B.a9r,B.a9y,B.a9v],t.jF)
B.a9j=new A.lm("visit","How to say it","The words are said with understanding, out loud, with the imam. These cards are for the visit. They are not a verse and not a hadith.","If you are not sure you mean it, wait and talk. Do not rush.",B.H,null,B.fJ,B.a_W)
B.a13=s([B.a9j],t.dY)
B.a9g=new A.wQ("imam","Say it with the imam","How you say it here, in person. A guide for the visit.",B.bR,B.a13)
B.Wm=new A.ab(61563,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.a9x=new A.mm(B.uW,"Washing, then the prayer","Learn wudu with the imam, then the five daily prayers. Open Salah in this app as a reminder of the times. The imam teaches the prayer itself.")
B.a9t=new A.mm(B.hS,"The rest of the five","Open Islam Basics for the pillars, each one with its proof. Do not stop at the testimony.")
B.a9s=new A.mm(B.uv,"Your name","You do not have to change your name. If you want a Muslim name, ask the imam. He will not invent one for show.")
