B.IW=new A.eV("one","Allah is One","This whole short surah is about Allah alone. Muslims worship Him. We do not worship the Prophet (peace be upon him), the Kaaba, or any person.",null,B.a1z,null)
B.IN=new A.eV("asked","What the angel asked","Jibril came and asked the Prophet (peace be upon him) what faith is, what Islam is, and what excellence is. Read his answer below. Do not swap it for a shorter list of your own.","This is Sahih al-Bukhari. A wording in Sahih Muslim adds detail. If they seem to differ, ask the imam. Do not pick one and ignore the other.",B.H,50)
