B.a29=s(["2:43"],t.s)
B.IL=new A.eV("zakat","Zakat","Zakat is a required share of qualifying wealth, not a tip. Many people give 2.5% of cash and gold after a lunar year, once they are above the nisab. That rate is the common teaching. It is not this verse. This app does not work out your number.",null,B.a29,null)
